      "exact_statement": "With ell=log(n/a), z_n=f_n/|f_1|, Delta mathfrak B_N={-s_*'ell f_n+kappa_N[J_(a,x)+mu_aJ_a]}/|f_1|=Delta W_A. Thus Re(Delta mathfrak B_N)=Delta A_a/|f_1|.",
      "id": "mactg_04_recurrence",
