      "exact_statement": "If n=r^2, D changes from r-1 to r. Put R_r=sum_(d<r)[Lambda(d)+Lambda(r)]z_(dr), D_r=Lambda(r)z_(r^2), and A_n=sum_(d|n,d<r)[Lambda(d)+Lambda(n/d)]z_n. Then Delta Z_square=R_r+D_r and Delta Z_wing=A_n-R_r.",
